      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are hotlines but it doesn't change the reality. everyone i know looks at me like i'm a walking disaster now. the shame is just... it's constant. it's like there's no way to ever walk into a room again and feel like a person. i just see the crash coming, the absolute bottom where i'm just a joke to everyone.",
