    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy won't change what happened. it doesn't fix the fact that i've lost everything. i'm just tired of the descent. it's like i'm watching a slow motion car crash and i'm just waiting for the impact. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... stop the fall before i hit the bottom and have to face the humiliation of being nothing.",
